  <item>
    <title>Vol. 2 谁能定义我的爱｜爱恨交织的饭圈文化(下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/633ecbe29186d4e4c46a0b7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">633ecbe29186d4e4c46a0b7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Oct 2022 12:36:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl28b2QOsDb4tUy-DwP6whcqPZK7.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“散粉”、“毒唯”、“插旗”、“圈地自萌”......请问以上饭圈黑话各位知多少。有道是““天下苦饭圈久矣”，粉圈发展至今自成逻辑，圈内人汲汲营营；圈外人雾里看花。本期是闲谈粉丝文化的下集，话题包括追星文化仪式感、学术娱乐化、虚拟偶像等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜高亮时间轴｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> 东京偶像：日本追星的宗教感与仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a> 政治参与：当BTS粉丝在推特上支持#BlackLivesMatter#</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a> 血汗泪：K-POP造星工厂与校园霸凌退圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 一声粉丝大过天：语言中的尊卑感、鞠躬与下跪文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 学术娱乐化：学者网红的孵化与利弊之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> 娱乐业进入元宇宙：从韩国女团Aespa谈起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">22:37</a> 去中心化：粉丝也能成为产消者和意见领袖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1684">28:04</a> 塑造神话：虚拟偶像不会塌房吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1954">32:34</a> 自恋文化：为什么我们喜欢数字虚拟形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">36:25</a> 玲娜贝儿：被遮蔽的真人劳动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 虚拟偶像是一种无菌审美的表现</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜资料工具包｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>文本资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《文本盗猎者：电视粉丝与参与式文化》-亨利詹金斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>《粉丝文化流变：媒介变迁背景下中国粉丝的成长简史》-全媒派</span></p><span></span><p><span>《从Fandom1.0到2.0: 粉丝实践的文化变迁》-崔迪</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Fan: The Mirror of Consumption》-Cornel Sandvoss</span></p><span></span><p><span>影视资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《东京偶像》《血汗泪》《孤注》</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期音乐｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>Life's Too Short -Aespa</span></p><span></span><p><span>Eill- Avishai Cohen</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜互动反馈｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果对本期节目有任何想法及问题，欢迎在平台评论区回复我们~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liJcSZQO965UMTJr7uM1bklb7CTP.m4a" length="43953049" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmdpjTBflB68QF5DXEoAQ2Cq0bVZ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 2 谁能定义我的爱｜爱恨交织的饭圈文化(上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/633e8b09e67030aadb38eafb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">633e8b09e67030aadb38eafb</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Oct 2022 08:00:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FowhA97VMpACLjy7N0dkojG3eI_8.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“散粉”、“毒唯”、“插旗”、“圈地自萌”......请问以上饭圈黑话各位知多少。有道是““天下苦饭圈久矣”，粉圈发展至今自成逻辑，圈内人汲汲营营；圈外人雾里看花。</span><strong><span>本期我们将以易烊千玺事件作为楔子，以自身经历及观察体悟作为线索，从明星塌房、粉丝文化变迁、偶像工业化等角度聊聊让我们爱恨交织的粉丝文化。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>｜高亮时间轴｜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 缘起：易烊千玺算塌房了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> 我们能接受明星偶像既富且贵吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 为什么谷爱凌能成为现象级偶像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 追星式学习：因喜爱香港流行文化而主动学粤语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 主流与小众的分野：欧美粉丝vs哈日哈韩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1064">17:44</a> 粤语沙文主义：生生不息中粉丝为何骂李健</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 饭圈就像软柿子：警惕负面评价追星行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">27:17</a> 文本盗猎者：明星应不应该为粉丝的行为负责</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1511">25:11</a> 文化行动主义：代餐文学与粉丝的能动性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 粉丝文化变迁索引：全民狂欢与情感参与</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2628">43:48</a> 当我想进入微博超话进行粉丝研究</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2842">47:22</a> 偶像工业化：韩国粉丝团体如何运作</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜资料工具包｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>文本资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《文本盗猎者：电视粉丝与参与式文化》-亨利詹金斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>《粉丝文化流变：媒介变迁背景下中国粉丝的成长简史》-全媒派</span></p><span></span><p><span>《从Fandom1.0到2.0: 粉丝实践的文化变迁》-崔迪</span></p><span></span><p><span>《粉丝文化是如何被异化的？从“倒奶打投”谈起》-界面</span></p><span></span><p><span>《专访亨利·詹金斯：粉丝的权利和边界在哪？》-三联生活周刊</span></p><span></span><p><span>《“反肖战”背后：疯狂的粉丝是怎样炼成的？》-新京报书评周刊</span></p><span></span><p><span>《粉丝文化研究的流变与反思》-朱丽丽</span></p><span></span><p><span>《改革开放后粉丝文化的三次“历史转型”》-姜明</span></p><span></span><p><span>《新媒介环境下的粉丝文化构建》-冯雪曾</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Fan: The Mirror of Consumption》-Cornel Sandvoss</span></p><span></span><p><span>影视资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《谷爱凌：我，18》《超级女声》《青春有你》《粉丝公众》</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期音乐｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱人错过-告五人</span></p><span></span><p><span>Arvoles- Avishai Cohen</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜互动反馈｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果对本期节目有任何想法及问题，欢迎在平台评论区回复我们~</span></p>]]></description>
